//// The `onze` package — module-tree root.
////
//// The vocabulary the three libraries do not share — `OnzeConfig`, `OnzeProject`,
//// `AppFile`, `AliasMap`/`resolveAlias`, the public-env rule and `Onze.run` —
//// filled by front 49, which owns this `root.bp` and `botopink.json`.
////
//// A skeleton created by front 95 (`specs/1.0.10-beta/06-onze/modules.md`
//// § The cut): an empty `pub` surface and one inline test, so the member is a
//// row of `zig build test-libs` from the first commit. Owner: front 49.

test "onze: the member compiles and runs on its rows" {
    assert "onze".length() == 4;
}
